<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n84701" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠ-γηθής</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολῠ-γᾱθής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γηθέω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>much-cheering, delightful,
				gladsome,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					21.450
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διώνυσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Th.</u>
					941
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Op.</u>
				614
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				29.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Διὸς εὐναί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>P.</u>
					2.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρχηθμός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					9.189
				</span></i>
			, etc.: also voc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γηθε</span> (as if
			from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-γηθος</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				10.10
			</span></i>.</div>
